   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear MSstats team,<div><br></div><div>I am trying to deselect the MBimpute option as follows:<br><div><br></div><div>quant&lt;-dataProcess(msstats.raw, fillIncompleteRows=TRUE,\r\nnormalization=&quot;quantile&quot;, MBimpute=FALSE)<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><u></u></p></div></div><div><br></div><div>However, I still obtain the <span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\">MissingPercentace &amp; ImputationPercentage data in the testing result table. Therefore, I am not sure if imputation was deselected.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\">Could you please clarify?</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><br></span></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Silvia</div><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <br></span></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "Vs9F_pjjCAAJ",
   "from": "Meena Choi",
   "author": "df9ba0266a9a081f",
   "date": "2016-06-23T16:14:15Z",
   "subject": "Re: Imputation with MBimpute",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Thank you for giving us to clarify the combination of options.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">1. imputation, with model-based value</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">quant </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dataProcess</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">msstats</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">raw</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fillIncompleteRows</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normalization</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;quantile&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">2. imputation, not model based imputation, but just impute with minimum value per feature for NA censored value.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">quant </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dataProcess</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">msstats</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">raw</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fillIncompleteRows</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normalization</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;quantile&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">MBimpute</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">3. no imputation, there is no censored Intensity.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">quant </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dataProcess</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">msstats</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">raw</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fillIncompleteRows</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normalization</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;quantile&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> censoredInt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">all three combination will have different results.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">If you don&#39;t want any imputation, please use option 3.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Hope to help.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">-Meena</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
