le=\"color:#000\"> dataProcess</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">msstats</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">raw</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fillIncompleteRows</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normalization</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;quantile&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">MBimpute</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">3. no imputation, there is no censored Intensity.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">quant </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dataProcess</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">msstats</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">raw</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fillIncompleteRows</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normalization</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;quantile&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> censoredInt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">all three combination will have different results.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">If you don&#39;t want any imputation, please use option 3.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Hope to help.</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">-Meena</div></div></blockquote></div>"
